Here is the dynamic dashboard UI to present your metrics overview. 

It is split into a clean two-column layout:
- **Left Column**: Contains your four KPI tiles using a compact metric row, featuring active users, revenue, uptime SLA, and latency trends.
- **Right Column**: Contains a quarterly performance bar chart to compare current-year vs. previous-year data.

### 1. Create the Surface
First, we request the creation of a new rendering surface for our metrics overview:

<a2ui-json>
{
  "version": "v0.9.1",
  "createSurface": {
    "surfaceId": "metrics-overview-dashboard",
    "catalogId": "https://a2uicatalog.ai/catalog/c-data-display.json"
  }
}
</a2ui-json>

### 2. Update the Components
Next, we populate the surface with our layout, headers, the four KPI tiles, and the comparison chart:

<a2ui-json>
{
  "version": "v0.9.1",
  "updateComponents": {
    "surfaceId": "metrics-overview-dashboard",
    "components": [
      {
        "id": "root",
        "component": "columns",
        "cols": 2,
        "gap": "2rem",
        "items": [
          {
            "blocks": [
              {
                "id": "kpi_header",
                "component": "heading",
                "text": "Key Performance Indicators"
              },
              {
                "id": "kpis_row",
                "component": "metric_row",
                "cols": 2,
                "metrics": [
                  {
                    "value": "45.2k",
                    "label": "Active Users",
                    "trend": "up",
                    "sub": "+12.3% vs last month"
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "$128,500",
                    "label": "Monthly Revenue",
                    "trend": "up",
                    "sub": "+8.4% vs last month"
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "99.95%",
                    "label": "Platform Uptime",
                    "trend": "up",
                    "sub": "SLA target: 99.9%"
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "180 ms",
                    "label": "Avg Latency",
                    "trend": "down",
                    "sub": "-15ms vs last week"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "blocks": [
              {
                "id": "chart_header",
                "component": "heading",
                "text": "Quarterly Comparison"
              },
              {
                "id": "performance_chart",
                "component": "chartjs_bar",
                "labels": ["Q1", "Q2", "Q3", "Q4"],
                "datasets": [
                  {
                    "label": "Current Year",
                    "data": [12000, 15000, 18000, 24000]
                  },
                  {
                    "label": "Previous Year",
                    "data": [10000, 11500, 13000, 16000]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
</a2ui-json>
